      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- TryScent — Social proof (kvinnor) — Custom Liquid paste block.\n     8 recensioner från Trustpilot (se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co), hämtade 19.08.2026.\n     Teman: kvalitet, hållbarhet, likhet med originalet, skepsis som vändes.\n     Ren HTML+CSS, scoped till .ts-proof-sv. Inga Liquid-taggar. -->\n\n<style>\n  .ts-proof-sv{\n    --green:#14843d;\n    --green-dark:#0f6b31;\n    --green-soft:#eaf6ee;\n    --ink:#111315;\n    --muted:#626b74;\n    --line:#e6e8e8;\n    --star:#ffb000;\n    font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n    color:var(--ink);\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f7f8f6);\n    padding:76px 0 53px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\n  .ts-proof-sv .container{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 36px));margin-inline:auto}\n  .ts-proof-sv .proof-head{text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 15px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .kicker{\n    font-size:13px;\n    letter-spacing:.13em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    font-weight:800;\n    color:var(--green);\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .section-title{\n    font-size:clamp(26px,3.3vw,43px);\n    line-height:1.02;\n    letter-spacing:-.045em;\n    margin-bottom:12px;\n    font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .carousel{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    gap:22px;\n    overflow-x:auto;\n    scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;\n    scrollbar-width:none;\n    padding:8px 4px 22px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .carousel::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card{\n    flex:0 0 calc(33.333% - 15px);\n    min-width:330px;\n    scroll-snap-align:start;\n    background:#fff;\n    border:1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius:20px;\n    padding:26px 26px 13px;\n    box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(16,34,22,.06);\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-top{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    gap:14px;\n    margin-bottom:11px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-stars{color:var(--star);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:19px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .verified{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\n  .ts-proof-sv .verified:hover{text-decoration:underline}\n  .ts-proof-sv .tp-dot{color:var(--green)}\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card h3{\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.22;\n    letter-spacing:-.035em;\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n    font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card p{\n    color:var(--muted);\n    line-height:1.62;\n    font-size:15px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card p.result-line{\n    margin:8px 0 12px;\n    padding:15px 16px;\n    border-radius:14px;\n    background:var(--green-soft);\n    color:var(--green-dark);\n    font-weight:800;\n    font-size:14px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .person{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .person strong{display:block;font-size:14px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .person span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35;display:block}\n  @media (max-width:1024px){\n    .ts-proof-sv .review-card{flex-basis:48%}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:700px){\n    .ts-proof-sv{padding:30px 0 21px}\n    .ts-proof-sv .review-card{min-width:86%;flex-basis:86%}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"ts-proof-sv\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"proof-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">D&#228;rf&#246;r fastnade de f&#246;r TryScent</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">De s&#228;ger det b&#228;ttre &#228;n vi n&#229;gonsin skulle kunna.</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"carousel\">\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Jag hade inte stora f&#246;rv&#228;ntningar p&#229; att det h&#228;r faktiskt skulle vara legit.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Jag hade en liten tester p&#229; JPG La Belle hemma att j&#228;mf&#246;ra med och blev &#246;verraskad hur pass lika de luktade. Best&#228;llde &#228;ven Lost Cherry dupe, YSL Black Opium dupe, CH Very Good Girl dupe och Acqua Di Gio dupe till min pojkv&#228;n, som ocks&#229; blev positivt &#246;verraskad. Super v&#228;rt det, och jag kommer best&#228;lla d&#228;rifr&#229;n igen.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">J&#228;mf&#246;rd sida vid sida med originalet.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Anne Rittwage</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Var lite skeptisk n&#228;r jag best&#228;llde.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Men efter en v&#228;ldigt snabb leverans s&#229; kunde jag konstatera att parfymerna var otroligt lika orginalen. V&#228;ldigt n&#246;jd!</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Tveksam innan. &#214;vertygad efter.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Annelie</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Parfymerna h&#229;ller h&#246;g kvalitet, doftar fantastiskt och sitter kvar l&#228;nge p&#229; huden.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Jag &#228;r verkligen imponerad av TryScent! Best&#228;llningen var enkel att g&#246;ra, leveransen gick smidigt och produkterna var v&#228;l f&#246;rpackade. Ett prisv&#228;rt alternativ f&#246;r den som vill ha lyxiga dofter utan att betala &#246;verpris. Jag kommer definitivt att handla h&#228;r igen och kan varmt rekommendera TryScent!</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Lyxk&#228;nsla utan lyxpriset.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Maria</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Jag k&#228;nde doften av mig sj&#228;lv hela tiden.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>N&#228;r man anv&#228;nder parfym annars brukar doften f&#246;rsvinna ganska snabbt. Fick h&#246;ra av andra att &#8211; ooj vad gott du luktar, vad har du p&#229; dig? Den &#228;r v&#228;ldigt kvalitativ och lyxig. Och jag f&#229;r k&#228;nna mig bekv&#228;m och kvinnlig.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Maria</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Parfymerna &#228;r otroligt vackra och de doftar exakt lika orginaliskt.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Jag k&#246;pte 3 flaskor och jag fick tv&#229; tester gratis.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Huda</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Parfymerna luktar v&#228;ldigt gott och &#228;r likt de riktiga.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>En bra hemsida att shoppa p&#229;. H&#229;ller l&#228;nge p&#229; kroppen.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Ellen Gustafsson</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Lukter som h&#229;ller l&#228;nge och verkligen luktar som orginalet.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Alltid snabba leveranser.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">H&#229;ller. Och luktar r&#228;tt.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Ingela</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Alla luktar magiskt gott.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Best&#228;llde fyra olika dofter och fick dem plus en femte som g&#229;va. Leveransen gick j&#228;ttefort! S&#229; himla n&#246;jd!</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Nathalie</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
